SUMMARY:Robert Abela takes power (Malta)
DESCRIPTION:Robert Abela is a Maltese lawyer and politician who has served 
 as prime minister of Malta and leader of the Malta Labour Party since 2020
 \, following the resignation of Joseph Muscat on 13 January that year. The
  son of former president George Abela\, he was elected to Parliament in 20
 17.\n\nNew leader: Malta\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Abe
 la\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev
 ).
CATEGORIES:New leader
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Abela
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
