SUMMARY:Assassination of Qasem Soleimani (Iraq)
DESCRIPTION:On 3 January 2020\, Qasem Soleimani\, an Iranian major general\
 , was assassinated by an American drone strike ordered by U.S. president D
 onald Trump near Baghdad International Airport in Iraq\, while travelling 
 to meet Iraqi prime minister Adil Abdul-Mahdi.\n\nAssassination: Iraq\nSou
 rce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Qasem_Soleimani\nText:
  Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Assassination
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Qasem_Soleimani
