SUMMARY:Pandemic: COVID-19 pandemic in Europe (Norway)
DESCRIPTION:The global COVID-19 pandemic arrived in Europe with its first c
 onfirmed case in Bordeaux\, France\, on 24 January 2020\, and subsequently
  spread widely across the continent. By 17 March 2020\, every country in E
 urope had confirmed a case\, and all have reported at least one death\, wi
 th the exception of Vatican City.\n\nCrisis: Norway\nSource: https://en.wi
 kipedia.org/wiki/COVID-19_pandemic_in_Europe\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
 0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
