SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2020 Nice stabbing (France)
DESCRIPTION:On the morning of 29 October 2020\, three people were killed in
  a stabbing attack at Notre-Dame de Nice\, a Catholic basilica in Nice\, F
 rance. The attacker\, Tunisian man Brahim Aouissaoui\, was shot by the pol
 ice and taken into custody. He was convicted and sentenced to life impriso
 nment in 2025.\n\nCrisis: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/20
