DESCRIPTION:On 2 November 2020\, three gunmen stormed the campus of Kabul U
 niversity in Kabul\, under the former Islamic Republic of Afghanistan\, ki
 lling 32 people and wounding 50 others. The attack began around the time t
 hat government officials were expected to arrive at the campus for the ope
 ning of an Iranian book fair.\n\nCrisis: Afghanistan\nSource: https://en.w
 ikipedia.org/wiki/2020_Kabul_University_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 
