SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2020 Vienna attack (Austria)
DESCRIPTION:On 2 November 2020\, a series of shootings took place in Vienna
 \, Austria a few hours before the city was scheduled to enter a lockdown a
 s a result of the COVID-19 pandemic. A lone gunman started shooting in the
  busy city centre\, killing four civilians and injuring 23 others\, seven 
 critically\, including a police officer.\n\nCrisis: Austria\nSource: https
 ://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_Vienna_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0
 )\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
