 \, located 32 km (20 mi) south of Mamuju. It was preceded by a Mw 5.7 fore
 shock several hours prior.\n\nCrisis: Indonesia\nSource: https://en.wikipe
 dia.org/wiki/2021_West_Sulawesi_earthquake\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)
