SUMMARY:2020 Oregon Ballot Measure 110 (United States)
DESCRIPTION:In November 2020\, voters in the U.S. state of Oregon passed Ba
 llot Measure 110\, "[reclassifying] possession/penalties for specified dru
 gs". It reclassifies possession of drugs including heroin\, methamphetamin
 e\, PCP\, LSD and oxycodone as a Class E civil violation.\n\nReferendum: U
 nited States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_Oregon_Ballot_Mea
 sure_110\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pag
 es.dev).
