DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Liechtenstein on 7 February 2021
  to elect the 25 members of the Landtag. The Patriotic Union (VU) and Prog
 ressive Citizens' Party (FBP) both won ten seats\, with the VU receiving j
 ust 42 votes more than the FBP.\n\nElection: Liechtenstein\nSource: https:
 //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2021_Liechtenstein_general_election\nText: Wikiped
