SUMMARY:Assassination: Murder of Peter R. de Vries (Netherlands)
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 6 July 2021\, Dutch investigative journalist 
 and crime reporter Peter R. de Vries was shot in the head after leaving th
 e television studio of RTL Boulevard in Amsterdam\, where he had appeared 
