 y 2021\, sparked by the imprisonment of former President Jacob Zuma for co
 ntempt of court.\n\nProtest: South Africa\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.or
 g/wiki/2021_South_African_unrest\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vit
 ruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
