SUMMARY:Coup: 2021 Guinean coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:On 5 September 2021\, President of Guinea Alpha Condé was capt
 ured by the country's armed forces in a coup d'état after gunfire in the 
 capital\, Conakry. Special forces commander Mamady Doumbouya released a br
 oadcast on state television announcing the dissolution of the constitution
  and government.\n\nCoup: Guinea\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/20
 21_Guinean_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruv
