SUMMARY:2021 Kuomintang chairmanship election (Taiwan)
DESCRIPTION:The 2021 Kuomintang chairmanship election was scheduled to be h
 eld in July 2021. It was postponed due to the COVID-19 pandemic\, and even
 tually rescheduled for 25 September 2021. It was the tenth direct election
  of the party leader in Kuomintang (KMT) history. All registered\, due-pay
 ing KMT party members were eligible to vote.\n\nParty contest: Taiwan\nSou
 rce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2021_Kuomintang_chairmanship_election\n
