SUMMARY:Coup: January 2022 Burkina Faso coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:A coup d'état was launched in Burkina Faso on 24 January 2022.
  Gunfire erupted in front of the presidential residence in the Burkinabé 
 capital Ouagadougou and several military barracks around the city. Soldier
 s were reported to have seized control of the military base in the capital
 . The government denied there was an active coup in the country.\n\nCoup: 
