 uring Belarus and seized the entire area of the Chernobyl Nuclear Power Pl
 ant by the end of that day.\n\nConflict: Ukraine\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/Capture_of_Chernobyl\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via V
