SUMMARY:2022 Italian referendum (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:A five-part abrogative referendum was held in Italy on 12 June 
 2022. Voters were asked to decide on the repeal of five articles or decree
 s relating to the functions of the Italian judicial system. Each of the fi
 ve questions were submitted by nine Italian regions\, all governed by the 
 centre-right coalition.\n\nReferendum: Italy\nSource: https://en.wikipedia
 .org/wiki/2022_Italian_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vi
