SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2022 Oslo shooting (Norway)
DESCRIPTION:The 2022 Oslo shooting\, commonly known in Norway as the Pride 
 Shooting in Oslo\, occurred on 25 June 2022\, when two people were killed 
 and twenty-one people were wounded in a mass shooting in Oslo\, Norway. Po
 lice declared the incident as an "act of Islamist terrorism".\n\nCrisis: N
 orway\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Oslo_shooting\nText: Wik
 ipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
