SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Stabbing of Salman Rushdie (United States)
DESCRIPTION:On August 12\, 2022\, Indian-born British-American novelist Sal
 man Rushdie was stabbed multiple times by 24-year-old Hadi Matar as he was
  about to give a public lecture at the Chautauqua Institution in Chautauqu
 a\, New York\, United States. Matar was immediately arrested and charged t
 he following day with assault and attempted murder.\n\nCrisis: United Stat
 es\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stabbing_of_Salman_Rushdie\nText
