SUMMARY:Earthquake: 2022 Papua New Guinea earthquake
DESCRIPTION:On 11 September 2022\, an earthquake of moment magnitude 7.6–
 7.7 struck Papua New Guinea\, in the northern part of Morobe Province. The
  normal faulting earthquake occurred with a hypocenter depth of 116.0 km (
 72.1 mi) beneath the Finisterre Range. A maximum perceived Modified Mercal
 li intensity of VIII (Severe) was estimated.\n\nCrisis: Papua New Guinea\n
 Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Papua_New_Guinea_earthquake\nTe
