 eople died\, 7\,729 were injured and five remain missing.\n\nCrisis: Indon
 esia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_West_Java_earthquake\nTex
 t: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
