SUMMARY:Earthquake: 2023 Turkey–Syria earthquakes
DESCRIPTION:On 6 February 2023\, two earthquakes devastated southern and ce
 ntral Turkey and northern and western Syria. The first earthquake occurred
  at 04:17:35 TRT (01:17:35 UTC)\, measuring moment magnitude (Mw) of 7.8. 
 The epicenter was 37 km (23 mi) west–northwest of Gaziantep.\n\nCrisis: 
 Turkey\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Turkey%E2%80%93Syria_ea
 rthquakes\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pa
