SUMMARY:2023 Montenegrin presidential election (Montenegro)
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Montenegro on 19 March 2023
 . Long-ruling incumbent president Milo Đukanović was eligible for re-ele
 ction. Since no candidate received a majority of the vote\, a second round
  vote was held on 2 April. In the first round\, Đukanović\, leader of th
 e populist DPS\, received 35%\, coming first.\n\nElection: Montenegro\nSou
 rce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Montenegrin_presidential_election\
