SUMMARY:Assassination of Vladlen Tatarsky (Russia)
DESCRIPTION:On 2 April 2023\, a bombing occurred in the Street Food Bar No.
 1 café on Universitetskaya Embankment in Saint Petersburg\, Russia. Russi
 an military blogger Vladlen Tatarsky\, real name Maxim Fomin\, died as a r
 esult of the explosion and 42 people were injured\, 24 of whom were hospit
 alized\, including six in critical conditions.\n\nAssassination: Russia\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Vladlen_Tatarsky\nTe
 xt: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
