  on 14 May\, various organizations carried out opinion polling to gauge vo
 ting intention in Turkey. Results of such polls are displayed in this arti
 cle. These polls only include Turkish voters nationwide and do not take in
 to account Turkish expatriates voting abroad.\n\nElection: Turkey\nSource:
