SUMMARY:Evika Siliņa takes power (Latvia)
DESCRIPTION:Evika Siliņa is a Latvian politician who served as prime minis
 ter of Latvia from 2023 to 2026. From 2022 to 2023\, she served as Ministe
 r of Welfare in the second cabinet of prime minister Krišjānis Kariņš.
  She is a member of the Unity political party\, a member of the New Unity 
 alliance\, and the second female head of government of Latvia.\n\nNew lead
 er: Latvia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evika_Sili%C5%86a\nText:
