SUMMARY:Treaty signed: Alliance of Sahel States
DESCRIPTION:The Alliance of Sahel States is a political and economic union 
 in the Sahel region of Africa comprising Burkina Faso\, Mali and Niger. It
  originated as a mutual defense pact in 2023. All three member states are 
 under the control of military juntas following a string of successful coup
 s.\n\nTreaty: International\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Allianc
