DESCRIPTION:On 5 October 2023\, the Russian Armed Forces launched an Iskand
 er ballistic missile at residents gathered in a memorial service at a shop
  and cafe in Hroza\, Kupiansk Raion\, Kharkiv Oblast\, Ukraine\, killing 5
 9 and injuring at least 7 others. Among those killed in the airstrike was 
 a six-year-old boy.\n\nCrisis: Ukraine\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/w
