SUMMARY:Earthquake: 2023 Herat earthquakes (Afghanistan)
DESCRIPTION:Four large earthquakes measuring Mww 6.3 each and their aftersh
 ocks affected Herat Province in western Afghanistan in early October 2023.
  The first two earthquakes occurred on 7 October at 11:11 AFT and 11:42 AF
 T near the city of Herat\, followed by many aftershocks. On 11 and 15 Octo
 ber\, two other magnitude 6.3 earthquakes struck the same area.\n\nCrisis:
  Afghanistan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Herat_earthquakes
 \nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
