SUMMARY:Battle: Nahal Oz attack (Israel)
DESCRIPTION:The kibbutz of Nahal Oz and the adjacent military base near the
  northern Gaza Strip were attacked in 2023 as part of the October 7 attack
 s. In the attack\, more than 60 Israeli soldiers and 15 civilians were kil
 led. Some soldiers and eight civilians were kidnapped and taken to the Gaz
 a Strip.\n\nConflict: Israel\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nahal_
 Oz_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pa
