SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Alumim massacre (Israel)
DESCRIPTION:On 7 October 2023\, dozens of Hamas militants attacked Alumim\,
  a kibbutz close to the border fence with the Gaza Strip\, as part of the 
 surprise attack on Israel. There were 41 Thai and Nepalese foreigners work
 ing at the kibbutz. The militants killed between 16 and 17 of these worker
 s and kidnapped between five and eight of them.\n\nCrisis: Israel\nSource:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alumim_massacre\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 
 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
