 d out a massacre at Be'eri\, a kibbutz near the Gaza Strip. Hundreds of Ga
 zan militants and civilian looters attacked the kibbutz\, killing and abdu
 cting civilians while facing resistance from armed residents. Israeli secu
 rity forces regained control by the evening of 8 October.\n\nCrisis: Israe
