DESCRIPTION:On 11 November 2024\, 62-year-old Fan Weiqiu drove his SUV into
  people on the exercise track at the Zhuhai Stadium sports center in Zhuha
 i\, Guangdong\, China\, killing 38 and injuring 48 more. Weiqiu then attem
 pted to kill himself with a knife\; he was taken into custody and sent to 
