 old Afghan asylum seeker Farhad Noori\, was arrested at the scene and sent
 enced to life imprisonment in August 2026.\n\nCrisis: Germany\nSource: htt
 ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_Munich_car_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
