SUMMARY:Christian Stocker takes power (Austria)
DESCRIPTION:Christian Stocker is an Austrian politician who has served as c
 hancellor of Austria since March 2025. A member of the People's Party (ÖV
 P)\, he has been a member of the National Council since 2019 and Chair of 
