SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2025 Vancouver car attack (Canada)
DESCRIPTION:On April 26\, 2025\, a vehicle-ramming attack took place shortl
 y after the Lapu-Lapu Day festival\, a public celebration of Filipino heri
 tage in Vancouver\, British Columbia\, Canada. The attack left 11 people d
 ead and at least 32 more injured\, making it the deadliest attack in Vanco
 uver's history.\n\nCrisis: Canada\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2
