DESCRIPTION:The 2025 Russia–United States Summit was a summit meeting bet
 ween United States president Donald Trump and Russian president Vladimir P
 utin. It was held on August 15\, 2025\, at Joint Base Elmendorf–Richards
 on in Anchorage\, Alaska. The main topic of discussion was the ongoing Rus
 so-Ukrainian war.\n\nSummit: United States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.o
