DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Samoa on 29 August 2025 to deter
 mine the composition of the 18th Parliament. Initially expected to be held
  in 2026\, Prime Minister Fiamē Naomi Mataʻafa called a snap election af
 ter parliament voted down the government budget on 27 May 2025.\n\nElectio
 n: Samoa\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_Samoan_general_electi
 on\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev
