SUMMARY:2025 Global Sumud Flotilla
DESCRIPTION:The Global Sumud Flotilla\, sometimes referred to as the Global
  Freedom Flotilla\, was an international\, civil society-led maritime init
 iative launched in mid-2025\, which attempted to break the Israeli blockad
 e of the Gaza Strip but was thwarted in an intercept by Israeli naval forc
 es. It is named after ṣumūd\, Arabic for 'steadfastness' or 'resilience
 '.\n\nProtest: International\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_G
 lobal_Sumud_Flotilla\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manag
 er (jdpi.pages.dev).
