SUMMARY:Assassination of Andriy Parubiy (Ukraine)
DESCRIPTION:Andriy Parubiy\, a Ukrainian politician\, was shot dead in Lviv
 \, Ukraine\, on 30 August 2025 at age 54. The attack occurred at around 10
 :35 am EEST on Yefremov Street. A suspect had been arrested in Khmelnytsky
 i Oblast by 1 September.\n\nAssassination: Ukraine\nSource: https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Andriy_Parubiy\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA
  4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
