DESCRIPTION:The SCO Tianjin Summit 2025 was the 25th Heads of State Council
  meeting of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization (SCO)\, which was held f
 rom 31 August to 1 September 2025\, in Tianjin\, China. It was the largest
  summit in SCO's history\, and was the fifth time that China hosted the me
 eting.\n\nSummit: China\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_Tianji
