SUMMARY:2025 Jamaican general election
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Jamaica on 3 September 2025. The
  incumbent Jamaica Labour Party (JLP) government\, led by Prime Minister A
 ndrew Holness\, won a third term in office against the opposition People's
  National Party (PNP). However\, the JLP lost 14 seats to the PNP\, still 
 retaining a majority.\n\nElection: Jamaica\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.o
 rg/wiki/2025_Jamaican_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, v
