 egan in the Philippines\, with the largest initial protests occurring on S
 eptember 11 at Rizal Park and Liwasang Bonifacio in Manila\, and at the Pe
 ople Power Monument\, Camp Aguinaldo Gate 4\, and EDSA Shrine along EDSA i
 n Quezon City\, both within Metro Manila.\n\nProtest: Philippines\nSource:
