DESCRIPTION:The 2025–2026 Albanian opposition protests were a series of a
 nti-government civic actions in Albania\, primarily in Tirana\, against Pr
 ime Minister Edi Rama and the Rama government. The larger context for the 
 protests was the allegations\, levied by the opposition\, of irregularitie
 s in the 2025 Albanian parliamentary election.\n\nProtest: Albania\nSource
 : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025%E2%80%932026_Albanian_opposition_prot
