 k offshore southern Mindanao in the Philippines. The United States Geologi
 cal Survey located the epicenter approximately 25 km (16 mi) southwest of 
 Kablalan at a depth of about 57 km (35 mi)\, while the Philippine Institut
 e of Volcanology and Seismology located it 32 km (20 mi) south of Maasim\,
 …\n\nCrisis: Philippines\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Min
 danao_earthquake\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (
 jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Mindanao_earthquake
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
