SUMMARY:2026 Serbian presidential election
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections will be held in Serbia by 26 December 20
 26 to elect the president of Serbia\, following the resignation of Aleksan
 dar Vučić to run for prime minister in the 2026 parliamentary election. 
 Vučić is ineligible to run again as president\, as he has served two con
 secutive terms.\n\nElection: Serbia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki
 /2026_Serbian_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via 
 Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
