SUMMARY:2027 Salvadoran presidential election (El Salvador)
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections are scheduled to be held in El Salvador 
 on 28 February 2027\, three years after the 2024 presidential election. Th
 ey will occur with concurrent legislative and municipal elections. In July
  2025\, the Legislative Assembly of El Salvador voted to move the date of 
 the next presidential election from 2029 to 2027.\n\nElection: El Salvador
 \nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2027_Salvadoran_presidential_elect
 ion\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.de
