SUMMARY:2027 Argentine general election (Argentina)
DESCRIPTION:General elections are scheduled to take place in Argentina on 2
 4 October 2027. Voters will elect the president and vice president of Arge
 ntina\, members in the Chamber of Deputies and Senate\, and the governors 
 of most provinces. Incumbent president Javier Milei is running for re-elec
 tion for a second term.\n\nElection: Argentina\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/2027_Argentine_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0
 )\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2027_Argentine_general_election
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
